review_comments_data.body:
@sanjayradadiya - this looks like it loops through the top level properties in the schema.

But, the date may be in a child object.  So, I think we actually need to "walk" the schema if the property is of `"type": "object"`:
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1108513/126161729-f6b8ec71-a3cd-45d9-8048-734098be71c9.png)

